{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01173","headline":"相和歌辞 从军行三首 三 · 李约","name":"相和歌辞 从军行三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"候火起雕城，尘砂拥战声。\n游军藏汉帜，降骑说蕃情。\n霜降滮池浅，秋深太白明。\n嫖姚方虎视，不觉请添兵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李约","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}